> So one skill lot per XL, am I right?

No, you're not, and that's the problem. Enhancing a weapons skill from
Unskilled to Basic takes 1 XL and 20 hits; from Basic to Skilled 2 XL
and 80 hits; from Skilled to Expert 3 XL and 180 hits. Enhancing either
BHC or a spell skill costs 1 XL for both Unskilled to Basic or Basic to
Skilled, and 2 XL from Skilled to Expert; you don't want to take BHC
that far, though, since it's fairly useless.
So in your case, apparently, you need 2 skill slots (=XL) for the dagger
skill, but you only have one, since you used them all up and then gained
only a single level. You'll need to gain another level before you can
enhance your dagger skill again.

BTW, enhancing quarterstaff all the way to Expert is generally not worth
it. You're never going to use that weapon again, since your forte is
casting spells, and you'll probably be wielding Magicbane all the time.

